cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SPHERExstack"
abstract: >
  Stack, slice, and animate any field of the SPHEREx sky survey: builds
  monochromatic mosaics, (RA, Dec, lambda) spectral cubes, and false-color
  RGB images directly from SPHEREx Level 2 spectral images retrieved from
  IRSA.
authors:
